California,Yes,,Yes,,Other,"Good time credits revocation (30 days), tied to general state vexatious litigant rule",NA,,"Cal. Gov't Code § 68635; Cal. Civ. Proc. Code § 391.7; and 2932.5. Also see In re Dexter, 603 P.2d 35, 37 (1979) and In re Muszalski, 52 Cal. App. 3d 500, 503, 125 Cal. Rptr. 286 (Ct. App. 1975)."
